# Pairs with BackupSagaConsistent (the requested
# DelegatedVerdictCachedUnderGate). A reader resolving a delegated txid under
# the gate caches the coordinator's verdict as a local decision after the
# snapshot was taken, so the terminal fan-out may apply on one shard while
# another still resolves the saga against the snapshot, where it has no local
# decision and reads pre-saga.
MODULE: BackupSagaConsistentDelegatedVerdictCachedUnderGate
TARGET: BackupSagaConsistent
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a delegated verdict is cached as a local decision while the gate is held
PERTURBS: CacheVerdict

--- FIND
CacheVerdict(t, T) ==
    /\ CrossTree(t)
    /\ dec[t] # "inflight"
    /\ deleg[t][T]
    /\ ~Gated(T)
--- REPLACE
CacheVerdict(t, T) ==
    /\ CrossTree(t)
    /\ dec[t] # "inflight"
    /\ deleg[t][T]
    \* MUTATION: caching is not suppressed under the gate.
--- END
